Streamlit App

1. Run Backend 

Activate VE
source kg_env/Scripts/activate

In VE Run above Command
python -m uvicorn app:app --reload

Keep Backend Running

2. Run Frontend


Activate VE
source kg_env/Scripts/activate

In VE Run above Command
streamlit run dashboard.py

Open browser:

http://127.0.0.1:8000


You MUST see:

{"status":"Backend is running"}


Also check:

http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs


You should see Swagger UI 🎉
